  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, deeper-issue investigation): umbrella enrolled 8 members; six further active items instantiate JSON-output / wire-format-vs-schema gaps and should be folded or cross-referenced: INV-rakot (slice JSON feature.query echo incomplete), INV-pomol (routes top-level field absent from bm.json — wire-format-vs-schema gap), INV-subak (config --format json function_summaries empty for all 281 langs), WI-lonoz (Edge.quality 100% null; 🟪 placeholder spec gap), INV-nuzal (edge.provenance + node.quality 100% empty), INV-pazur (tiered behavior maps: nodes_summary pre-shrink vs on-disk arrays). Deeper hypothesis: distinct from the INV-fabov/numat/kurup \"no validator gate\" cluster — WI-gogif is \"no shared output-shape convention across independently-grown subcommands\"; structural fix is a single JSON-output factory + envelope contract."  # f8d8
