  message: "F1 MECHANISM LANDED (not yet closed) — selfh/dev 1bf612d7bf. Extracted add_schema_envelope(payload, view=, schema_version=) single-sourcing the read-view JSON envelope across ~6 inline sites (slice x2/routes/verify-claims/test-coverage/handler-slice-index), producing the canonical SPREAD envelope per spec Appendix C (schema_version+view+payload at top level, NOT data-nested, no query field). SCOPE CORRECTION (scope-audit wf_fe9840e9): the tracker/strategy's {schema_version,view,query,data} data-nested shape CONTRADICTS spec Appendix C + 5 frozen per-view tests — the true contract is additive-spread with per-view schema_version (NOT unified; unification is WI-bobog). Byte-identical refactor (frozen tests green). WI-pofas/WI-kitud are DUPLICATE F1 framings (fold in). WI-gogif closes when the sub-metas resolve: INV-fivar (sub-A missing --format: WI-dulul cache-status + WI-soroz catalog), INV-pikob (sub-B envelope: INV-fipol dead-code-maybe + INV-pazum config), INV-rugah (sub-C wire-format). Next: sub-A leaves retrofit --format json onto cache-status/catalog via the new gateway."  # a03c
